    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "but you're just an AI, you don't actually get how heavy it is. it doesn't feel temporary. it feels like a fact. it's like... if someone is in a burning building and the only way out is the window, is it really \"illogical\" to jump? or is it just the only way to stop the pain?",
